  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> , since <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><msqrt><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Hence, locus of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></math> is a circle with radius <math><mn>1</mn></math>.</p>",
